## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Polina cannot mutate in auto-react** — `chat-internal/route.ts` `runAutoReactTool` hard-blocks ALL `tool.mutating` regardless of governance_mode + cookieHeader null. Root of the autonomy block. FIX = Polina-boldness agent (in worktree, not merged).
- **Mode-4 chain skips EREF+MGEN** — factory `spec.nextEvent` (thin) ≠ computeNextEvents (rich); WCHK→EDIT directly. = TD-87. Fixed in code, NOT live.
- **media-preflight "Media unreachable: 812aa5e9"** — preflight pulled text Bible (general_idea.md) as media. Regression from Gate-Hardening Phase1 (7c76a05, 2026-06-04) — first fresh EREF after it. Replay-pilot can't catch (skips preflight in mock mode). FIXED.
- **"No episode reference assets inserted"** — generic swallow of the REAL provider error (silent-failure). Two real causes hidden behind it: (a) size 1024×1792 invalid for gpt-image-2; (b) **OpenAI billing hard limit reached** (had to replicate the API call directly to find it). Both resolved.
- **HMR does NOT re-register Inngest functions** — copying factory.ts to master did NOT activate TD-87 live (worker still runs old code). Smoke SH03 showed no auto-execute. NEEDS WORKER RESTART.
- **anchor_chain=true incompatible with pilot** — anchor mode needs ALL 2×N anchors before animatic; can't do a 2-shot pilot. Set anchor OFF.
- **/hooks unavailable in Claude Code DESKTOP app** — can't verify the hook there; CC desktop also likely needs full app restart to load the new settings.json hook.
- **22-shot designer batch → 12 REVISION** — critic correctly flagged insufficient camera/angle variation (all in ONE bedroom). Root = STORYBOARDER skill (now patched). Did NOT force-approve (respect critic); will resolve on re-run.

